{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuwen-e-8ea565ee95d4d6fcda6b","title":"《袁子》论曹魏侯王空名与禁防","accounts":[{"id":"wuwen-a-8ea565ee95d4d6fcda6b","label":"裴注引《袁子》","text":"《袁子》论曹魏侯王空名与禁防","evidence":["wuwen-q-256bfe5b0e655f52c5ed"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wuwen-q-256bfe5b0e655f52c5ed"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuwen-q-256bfe5b0e655f52c5ed","order":4084}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"wuwen-q-256bfe5b0e655f52c5ed","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-39fcda7ec720535de547","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《袁子》曰：“魏兴，承大乱之后，民人损减，不可则以古始。于是封建侯王，皆使寄地空名，而无其实。王国使有老兵百余人，以卫其国；虽有王侯之号，而乃侪为匹夫。悬隔千里之外，无朝聘之仪，邻国无会同之制。诸侯游猎，不得过三十里；又为设防辅、监国之官以伺察之。王侯皆思为布衣而不能得。既违宗国藩屏之义，又亏亲戚骨肉之恩。”","attribution":"裴注引《袁子》","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-584514856fc31ade6cae","start":0,"end":158,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
